=2 Walkthrough
* Obtain {k:Celennia Memorial Library card} from {n:Patient Snake} in the {p:Scouts' Coalition} - {z:Eastern Adoulin} (F-9).
* Speak with {n:Reja Ygridhi} inside the {z:Celennia Memorial Library}.
* After a brief conversation and accepting the quest, you are given the {@k} {k:Twelve Orders dossier}.
* Visit the following people for each of the Twelve Orders:
** Order of Haverton: {n:Jozhud}, followed by {n:Palomel} at (G-9) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}.
*** If {n:Palomel} says "Oh, Maester Svenja, how I yearn to be swept up in your toned-yet-lithe arms and lose myself in your deep, calming gaze..." rather than the library related comment, you may need to complete {q:A Thirst for the Ages|A Thirst for the Ages|A Thirst for the Ages} first if it's currently flagged but incomplete. ({p:[1]|http://www.bluegartr.com/threads/115414-Colonization-Thread?p=5809506&viewfull=1#post5809506} Source)
*** If you are on {q:A Thirst for the Eons|A Thirst for the Eons|A Thirst for the Eons}, and she only gives you the dialog for that quest, you can skip over Palomel and still finish this quest.
** Order of Vocane: {n:Oscairn} at (G-7) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}.
** Order of Renaye: {n:Nhili Uvolep} at (I-7) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}.
** Order of Weatherspoon: {n:Rigobertine} at (J-7) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}, at the very top.
*** If she starts a cutscene, speak again until she talks about documents.
** Order of Gorney: {n:Oingo-Zoingo} at (K-9) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}.
** Order of Adoulin: {n:Ploh Trishbahk} at (K-9) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}, at the main gate.
*** If {n:Ploh Trishbahk} says "Thank you for proferring your {k:dinner invitation|Dinner invitation}..." rather than the library related comment, you may need to complete the mission {M:Meeting of the Minds|Seekers of Adoulin Mission 1-7|Meeting of the Minds} if it's currently flagged but incomplete.
** Order of Woltaris: {n:Chumli-Mojumli} at (K-10) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}. __(That's all for the Eastern half of the city.)__
** Order of Orvail: {n:Terwok} at (K-10) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
** Order of Thurandaut: {n:Marjoirelle} at (H-12) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
** Order of Janniston: {n:Grevan} at (I-8) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
** Order of Shneddick: {n:Mastan} at (G-6) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
** Order of Karieyh: {n:Oka Qhantari} at (D-8) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
* Return to {n:Reja Ygridhi} inside the {z:Celennia Memorial Library} for your reward.

